itle=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mapcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Map Color</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff3300; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"destructible\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Destructible</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVXBkYXRlcy8zLjE/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Updates/3.1 (page does not exist)\">3.1</span><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150531122756&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Oven_e3ee36.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an oven.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>When it is lit, it will turn into an Oven (Lit), provide light, baking possibilities, and look like this: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Oven (Lit)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Oven_Lit_565b40.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>.\n</p><p>Ovens are commonly found in various cities, for example in <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> near <a href=\"#/wiki/Mirabell\">Mirabell</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33173,31800,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33173, 31800, 6)</a>, or in Yalahar in <a href=\"#/wiki/Julius\">Julius</a> house. Players can purchase Oven (Movable) from <a href=\"#/wiki/Furniture%20Shopkeeper%20NPCs\">Furniture Shopkeeper NPCs</a> to use them in Houses and Guildhalls.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Al's Shop</li><li>Baking Tray (Reed)</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\">Bread</a></li><li>Bunch of Reed</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20%28Decorated%29\">Cake (Decorated)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chocolate%20Cake\">Chocolate Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cookie\">Cookie</a></li><li>Cooking</li><li>Cormaya House</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crunor%27s%20Fin